swift-json-render
Copyright 2026 Vatsal Saglani

A native Swift runtime for the json-render specification.

This product is a Swift implementation of the json-render specification by
Vercel Labs (https://github.com/vercel-labs/json-render, Apache License 2.0).
Parity fixtures under Tests/ParityFixtures/upstream are copied from that
repository at a pinned commit and keep their original licence.

Design ideas (the component macro and the JSON value and pointer types) are
adapted, with credit, from rxtech-lab/json-render-swift (MIT License).

Third-party material (as of 2026-11-08)

- vercel-labs/json-render (Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2025 Vercel Inc.):
  the specification this package implements; the prompt text, which is
  byte-exact in Tests/ParityFixtures/upstream/prompt/; and the parity
  fixtures under Tests/ParityFixtures/upstream/ (licence copied there).
- rxtech-lab/json-render-swift (MIT License): design ideas, and any lines
  copied with credit (the component macro, the JSON value and pointer types).
- swiftlang/swift-syntax (Apache License 2.0 with Runtime Library Exception):
  a build-time dependency of the macro target. Not part of a built app.
- swiftlang/swift-docc-plugin (Apache License 2.0 with Runtime Library
  Exception): used to build the documentation only.

Nothing else is vendored.
